- `wakeup_id`
- `idempotency_key UNIQUE`
- `status IN ('intent','launcher_accepted','agent_started','turn_submitted','turn_bound','failed')`
- `assigned_agent_id`
- `remote_agent_id`
- `thread_id`
- `turn_id`
- `launch_seq/session_id`
- `last_error`
- `created_at/updated_at`

并定义每个 crash window 的 replay 规则：intent 后、accepted 后、agent started 后、turn submitted 后、bind 前、ack 前。

